OL,3,GNEWSANew station for town due new
OL,4,Ahospital 'viable'
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne of Cheshire's largest towns could
OL,7,Fget a second railway station under
OL,8,Fplans being looked into by a local
OL,9,Fauthority.
OL,11,FA study by Cheshire East Council has
OL,12,Ffound a station for the Leighton area
OL,13,Fof Crewe would be "viable", although
OL,14,Fthe council said there would be "still
OL,15,Fa long way to go".
OL,17,FThe station for Leighton - where a new
OL,18,F#1.4bn hospital is to be built - would
OL,19,Fbe on the existing Crewe to Chester
OL,20,Frailway line.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,359,350,200,160,0,100
