OL,3,GNEWSANew station for town due new
OL,4,Ahospital 'viable'
OL,5,
OL,6,FMark Goldsmith, the cabinet member for
OL,7,Ftransport, said the new hospital,
OL,8,Fhousing developments in the area and a
OL,9,Fdesire for expansion by local
OL,10,Fmanufacturer Bentley Motors were "three
OL,11,Fgood reasons to want to improve the
OL,12,Flocal transport".
